3.11 Core-residue contact analysis 

To determine whether the selected ligands occupied the intended DBP rather than an alternative region of the receptor, the minimum distance between each docked ligand and each of the six core DBP residues was calculated. 

A 4 Å distance threshold was used to identify close ligand–residue contacts. 

